      "title": "Search query built from request input",
      "description": "The index action interpolates params[:q] directly into the SQL WHERE fragment. Any authenticated caller controls that text. Any authenticated caller can inject SQL and read or change any table, including api_token values. Pass q as a bound parameter and escape LIKE wildcards with sanitize_sql_like.",
      "suggested_change": "    users = users.where(\"email LIKE ?\", \"%#{User.sanitize_sql_like(params[:q])}%\") if params[:q].present?",
      "source": "semgrep:ruby.rails.security.injection.tainted-sql-string.tainted-sql-string",
      "candidate": "c1",
      "notes": [],
      "problem": "The index action interpolates params[:q] directly into the SQL WHERE fragment. Any authenticated caller controls that text.",
      "consequence": "Any authenticated caller can inject SQL and read or change any table, including api_token values.",
      "fix": "Pass q as a bound parameter and escape LIKE wildcards with sanitize_sql_like."
    },
