      "line_end": 2,
      "title": "Destroy action exempt from admin check",
      "description": "The change adds destroy to the except list of require_admin. The destroy action then deletes any user by id without an ownership check. Any authenticated user can delete every account, including admin accounts. Remove destroy from the except list so only admins can delete users.",
      "suggested_change": "  before_action :require_admin, except: [:index, :show]",
