      "title": "Welcome email sent on every save",
      "description": "The after_save callback runs on both create and update. The new update endpoint therefore emails the user a welcome message on every edit. Existing users get repeated welcome emails whenever an admin edits them or any code saves the record. Use after_create_commit so the welcome email goes out once after the user is created.",
      "suggested_change": "  after_create_commit :send_welcome_email",
      "source": null,
